      "creatureType": "construct",
      "blurb": "Illusionist: Phantasm",
      "biography": "<p><em>Phantasm (Illusionist, 2nd level).</em> Your illusory ally. It begins Small and looks as you describe, always tinged black (a crow, a snake, a small version of yourself). Summon it as an Action and command it as a Bonus Action on your turn. One at a time (two from Phantasmic Double); summoning another dispels the previous one. More than 120 feet from you, it's dispelled. Abilities it uses that require a saving throw use your Genjutsu Save DC. Spending 1 Actualization Die recharges one of its Recharge abilities.</p><p><strong>Illusion.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 20 · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 10 · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR, DEX, CON, INT, WIS, CHA: no modifier; saves +0. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> all, except Psychic, Force and Necrotic. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> all. <strong>Senses</strong> uses its summoner's senses.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its level, Genjutsu attack bonus, Genjutsu save DC and senses are set from yours.</p>",
      "summonRole": "Phantasm"
    },
